% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
% The fields of a listing that name the product (the listing format)
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
"item type" is a field that names the product,
    as stated in the other products listing format, confer "Item Type (99 listings): the kind of product in the seller's words".
"type" is a field that names the product,
    as stated in the other products listing format, confer "Type (124 listings)".
"category" is a field that names the product,
    as stated in the other products listing format, confer "Category (16 listings) and Product Type (10 listings)".
"product type" is a field that names the product,
    as stated in the other products listing format, confer "Category (16 listings) and Product Type (10 listings)".
"use" is a field that names the product,
    as stated in the other products listing format, confer "Use (39 listings) and Application (27 listings)".
"application" is a field that names the product,
    as stated in the other products listing format, confer "Use (39 listings) and Application (27 listings)".

